# SITL + Gazebo parameters on top of copter.parm and sim/drone_v2.parm
# Physics comes from Gazebo (JSON backend), so SIM_* frame parameters are not used.

# Rate loop for a light 5" quad (1.14 kg, Ixx 0.0025). Copter defaults (P 0.135, gyro filter 20 Hz) give a
# 15 Hz limit cycle on this model: rotors swing 60..780 rad/s at hover. Checked with sim/gazebo/hover_test.py 2026-09-16.
# Sim-only starting point: the real drone still needs AUTOTUNE.
INS_GYRO_FILTER  80
ATC_RAT_RLL_P    0.06
ATC_RAT_RLL_I    0.06
ATC_RAT_RLL_D    0.0015
ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTD 40
ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTT 40
ATC_RAT_PIT_P    0.06
ATC_RAT_PIT_I    0.06
ATC_RAT_PIT_D    0.0015
ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTD 40
ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTT 40
